# playpick cell: mode=menus view=820x1180,touch save=carried
#
# Probe only: reach a direct mode=raid pull of Bonegrinder 10-normal (a
# fresh/carried save only ever has this one open), kill it once with `good`,
# and read `targets` on the results screen to learn the actual button names
# for a kill (not a wipe) before scripting the real experiment -- README's
# "Getting better at it" section (the results-screen comparison line and
# personal-best banners) has never been tested by this job because every
# prior menus/carried session only ever saw one kill per playbot invocation,
# and #273 means state does carry within one invocation even though it never
# carries between them.
